{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24115","headline":"种桃歌 · 白居易","name":"种桃歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"食桃种其核，一年核生芽。\n二年长枝叶，三年桃有花。\n忆昨五六岁，灼灼盛芬华。\n迨兹八九载，有减而无加。\n去春已稀少，今春渐无多。\n明年後年後，芳意当如何。\n命酒树下饮，停杯拾余葩。\n因桃忽自感，悲吒成狂歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}